1
00:00:00,348 --> 00:00:02,448
(Leonard:)All right, do it.
Call him.

2
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:05,150
(Leonard:)Let's find out what this loser's
ever accomplished.

3
00:00:08,756 --> 00:00:10,826
(Sheldon:)Click it with me.

4
00:00:12,093 --> 00:00:13,523
(Leonard:)One, two, three...

5
00:00:13,527 --> 00:00:15,027
(Sheldon:)Click.
click.

6
00:00:15,029 --> 00:00:17,699
(line ringing)

7
00:00:17,698 --> 00:00:19,468
(mechanized voice):
Well, hello there.

8
00:00:19,467 --> 00:00:22,267
(Sheldon:)Professor Hawking?

9
00:00:22,269 --> 00:00:25,869
(Stephen Hawking:)Oh, brother, you should see
the look on your faces.

10
00:00:27,942 --> 00:00:30,342
(Leonard:)You really
didn't like our paper?

11
00:00:30,344 --> 00:00:32,944
(Stephen Hawking:)I like your paper very much.

12
00:00:32,947 --> 00:00:35,347
(Stephen Hawking:)The premise is intriguing.

13
00:00:35,349 --> 00:00:38,719
(Sheldon:)Then why are you
attacking us?

14
00:00:38,719 --> 00:00:41,349
(Stephen Hawking:)If you were sitting in a chair
for 40 years,

15
00:00:41,355 --> 00:00:43,455
(Stephen Hawking:)you'd get bored, too.

16
00:00:45,059 --> 00:00:46,559
(Stephen Hawking:)Anyway,

17
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:48,060
(Stephen Hawking:)got to go.

18
00:00:48,062 --> 00:00:51,862
I promised to help the neighbor
kid with his math homework.

19
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:54,600
(Stephen Hawking:)Ciao.

20
00:00:57,638 --> 00:01:00,338
(Leonard:)Stephen Hawking
liked our paper.

